# Split Group Controller Component

Factory pattern for creating controller instances (EOA or Safe) with type-specific configurations for managing 0xSplits contracts.

## Key Integration Pattern
Controller factory pattern with RawMessage for delayed configuration unmarshalling, allowing type-specific config parsing after controller type determination.

## Important Constraints
- Controller type must be validated before instantiation (no unknown types)
- Config defaults must be applied after unmarshalling for consistent initialization
- Each controller implementation must provide Start/Stop lifecycle methods and expose Type/Name/Address accessors